  "description": "The ducal family killed her sister. They destroyed her whole world. Now Summer has nothing—except her life. And now every moment of it is pointed towards one thing: revenge. Undercover as the noblewoman Adele, Summer slips into the Duke's home as an aide to his youngest son. From up close, she can finally enact her vengeance. But Summer is too close. Instead of avenging her sister, she finds herself falling for the very man she meant to destroy. Can his love overcome her pain? Is that justice? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
